      "source": "https://nearbylens.com/cities/usa/il/chandlerville/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Every summer, Chandlerville hosts the Burgoo Festival, a lively celebration featuring music, food, and a carnival that highlights the town’s traditions.",
